{"E:\\videos\\mickey7\\wt\\vlog\\mickey7\\voz\\b000_t3.wav": {"text": "See this? A chuck roast. Five dollars a pound at the meat counter. And hiding inside it is a steak that eats like a ribeye. Same juice, same crust, same fat melting on your tongue. Today I'm going to show you exactly where it is, how to cut it out, and how to cook it, so nobody at your table can tell the difference. Here's why I'm telling you this. A fella came into my shop last spring, a young mailman, holding a receipt. He'd taken his wife downtown for their anniversary. Two ribeyes, a couple of potatoes, a glass of wine each. One hundred and sixty-four dollars before the tip. He said, Mickey, it was good, but it wasn't a hundred and sixty-four dollars good. Is there anything I can do at home? And maybe you've tried. You bought a cheap steak, you cooked it hot, and it came out gray and tough, like chewing a rubber boot. So you figured cheap beef is just cheap beef.", "words": [{"w": " See", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.32}, {"w": " this?", "s": 0.32, "e": 0.84}, {"w": " A", "s": 0.84, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " chuck", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.72}, {"w": " roast.", "s": 1.72, "e": 2.98}, {"w": " Five", "s": 2.98, "e": 3.16}, {"w": " dollars", "s": 3.16, "e": 3.64}, {"w": " a", "s": 3.64, "e": 3.86}, {"w": " pound", "s": 3.86, "e": 4.24}, {"w": " at", "s": 4.24, "e": 4.9}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.9, "e": 5.1}, {"w": " meat", "s": 5.1, "e": 5.38}, {"w": " counter.", "s": 5.38, "e": 5.8}, {"w": " And", "s": 6.9, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " hiding", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.44}, {"w": " inside", "s": 7.44, "e": 7.98}, {"w": " it", "s": 7.98, "e": 8.24}, {"w": " is", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.74}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.74, "e": 8.88}, {"w": " steak", "s": 8.88, "e": 9.38}, {"w": " that", "s": 9.38, "e": 9.86}, {"w": " eats", "s": 9.86, "e": 10.14}, {"w": " like", "s": 10.14, "e": 10.44}, {"w": " a", "s": 10.44, "e": 10.64}, {"w": " ribeye.", "s": 10.64, "e": 11.14}, {"w": " Same", "s": 12.1, "e": 12.38}, {"w": " juice,", "s": 12.38, "e": 13.38}, {"w": "